<!doctype html>
<html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"/>
<title>Campaign Brief: {{ campaign_name }}</title>
<style>:root{color-scheme:light dark}
body{margin:0 auto;max-width:52rem;padding:2rem 1.25rem;
font:16px/1.6 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Segoe UI",Roboto,sans-serif;
color:#1b1b1b;background:#fff}
h1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6{line-height:1.25;margin:2rem 0 .6rem}
h1{font-size:1.9rem} h2{font-size:1.45rem} h3{font-size:1.15rem}
p,ul,ol,blockquote,table,pre{margin:0 0 1rem}
code{font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;font-size:.9em;
background:#f2f2f2;padding:.1em .3em;border-radius:3px}
pre{background:#f6f6f6;padding:.9rem 1rem;border-radius:5px;overflow-x:auto}
pre code{background:none;padding:0}
blockquote{border-left:3px solid #d0d0d0;margin-left:0;padding-left:1rem;
color:#4a4a4a}
table{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;display:block;overflow-x:auto}
th,td{border:1px solid #ddd;padding:.4rem .6rem;text-align:left}
th{background:#f6f6f6}
hr{border:0;border-top:1px solid #ddd;margin:2rem 0}
a{color:#0b57d0}
@media(prefers-color-scheme:dark){
body{color:#e6e6e6;background:#151515}
code{background:#242424} pre{background:#1d1d1d}
th{background:#1d1d1d} th,td{border-color:#333}
blockquote{border-left-color:#3a3a3a;color:#b0b0b0} a{color:#8ab4f8}}</style></head>
<body>
<h1>Campaign Brief: {{ campaign_name }}</h1>
<p><strong>Brand:</strong> {{ product_name }} <strong>Campaign objective:</strong> [One sentence: e.g. &quot;Generate 500 trial signups for {{ product }}&quot;] <strong>Timeline:</strong> {{ start_date }} — {{ end_date }} <strong>Budget:</strong> ${{ total }}</p>
<hr/>
<h2>Brand Context</h2>
<ul><li><strong>Product:</strong> [Name and one-sentence description]</li><li><strong>Key message:</strong> [One line — the core value proposition]</li><li><strong>Target audience:</strong> [Who your customers are — demographics, context]</li></ul>
<h2>Deliverables</h2>
<table><thead><tr><th>#</th><th>Content type</th><th>Platform</th><th>Quantity</th><th>Due date</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>1</td><td>[Post / Reel / Video / Story]</td><td>{{ platform }}</td><td>{{ count }}</td><td>[Date]</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr></tbody></table>
<h2>Creative Guidelines</h2>
<p><strong>Do:</strong></p>
<ul><li>[Guideline 1 — e.g., show product in a real use scenario]</li><li>{{ guideline_2 }}</li><li>{{ guideline_3 }}</li></ul>
<p><strong>Do not:</strong></p>
<ul><li>[Restriction 1 — e.g., do not compare to competitors by name]</li><li>{{ restriction_2 }}</li></ul>
<p><strong>Required elements:</strong></p>
<ul><li>Disclosure: #ad or #sponsored must appear in the first 3 hashtags or in visible text above the fold</li><li>Unique affiliate/discount code: [CODE] — include in all posts</li><li>UTM link: [URL] — use instead of homepage link</li><li>Tags: {{ yourbrand }} must be tagged in all posts</li></ul>
<h2>Approval Process</h2>
<ol><li>Creator submits draft content to {{ email_slack_channel }} by [date]</li><li>You review and approve (or request revision) within 48 hours</li><li>Creator publishes after written approval only</li></ol>
<h2>Compensation</h2>
<ul><li>Fee: ${{ amount }}</li><li>Affiliate commission: [X]% of sales via [CODE]</li><li>Payment terms: {{ payment_terms }} after content goes live</li><li>UGC usage rights: [90-day paid-social usage rights included / excluded]</li></ul>
<h2>Tracking</h2>
<ul><li>Unique discount code: [CODE]</li><li>UTM tracking link: [URL]</li><li>Report metrics to {{ email }} within 7 days of campaign end</li></ul>
</body></html>
